<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Racing plans property unit.</title>
<headline>Philippine Racing plans property unit.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Racetrack operator Philippine Racing Club Inc said on Thursday it was considering floating a separate company to develop its property holdings.</p>
<p>A stockholders meeting has been called on December 27 to discuss the issue, the company said in a disclosure to the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC).</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
